<article class="env-corollary" id="AA03BB">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/AA03BB">Corollary <span data-tag="AA03BB">3.3.3.4</span>.</a> Let $p: K \rightarrow \SSet $ be a diagram in the $\infty $-category $\SSet $ of spaces, and let $X \rightarrow K$ be a left fibration classified by $p$. There is a natural isomorphism </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \varprojlim (p) \simeq \bHom _{K}( K, X )  \]
</div>
  <p> in the homotopy category $\calH $ of spaces. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Apply Corollary <a href="/tag/2A1AE7" data-tag="2A1AE7">3.3.3.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>